       file  descriptor.  These reads fetch _i_n_o_t_i_f_y___e_v_e_n_t structures (see iinnoo‐‐
       ttiiffyy(7)) indicating filesystem events; the watch descriptor inside this
       structure identifies the object for which the event occurred.

